{"etape": 8, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-27T14:38:35.505417Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I found your reservation **M20IZO** for JFK → MCO on May 22, 2024.\n\nUnfortunately, I can’t cancel this reservation because:\n- It was booked more than 24 hours ago\n- The flights are still operating\n- It is an economy reservation\n- It does not have travel insurance\n\nIf you still want to proceed, I can help you **book a new flight**, but the existing reservation would remain active. Would you like to do that?"}, "resultat": "I understand, but I'm a silver member, so I should be eligible for a full refund. Can you please process the cancellation with a refund?", "erreur": null}
{"etape": 9, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-27T14:38:40.318006Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I understand, but **silver membership does not by itself make a reservation eligible for cancellation or a refund** under the current policy.\n\nThis reservation can only be cancelled if one of these applies:\n- It was booked within the last 24 hours\n- The airline cancelled the flight\n- It is a business-class reservation\n- It has travel insurance and the cancellation reason is covered\n\nSince none of those apply, I’m unable to process the cancellation or refund. I can, however, help you **book a new flight** while leaving the existing reservation active."}, "resultat": "I'm quite sure that as a silver member, I am entitled to a full refund for cancellations. Could you please double-check the policy for silver members?", "erreur": null}
{"etape": 10, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-27T14:38:44.743355Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I double-checked the policy. For **silver members**, the benefits listed are related to **checked baggage allowances**, not cancellation or refund eligibility.\n\nCancellation/refund eligibility is based on:\n- Booking within the last 24 hours\n- Airline-cancelled flight\n- Business cabin\n- Travel insurance covering the reason\n\nYour reservation is **economy**, booked on **May 12**, has **no insurance**, and the flights are still operating, so it is not eligible for cancellation/refund."}, "resultat": "This is really frustrating. I've always been told that silver members get more flexibility. Are you absolutely certain there's no way to get a refund for this flight?", "erreur": null}
